  "content": "\n\n<p>Просто небольшой модпак для моего сервера Minecraft (на данный момент сервер недоступен до дальнейших уведомлений)</p>\n<p><strong>Этот модпак добавляет различные приключенческие</strong>&nbsp;и<strong>&nbsp;косметические моды. Среди заметных: MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod, Wildfire's Female Gender Mod, Quark и многое другое!</strong><strong><br>В пакете также добавлены Origins для тех, кто любит играть с уникальными способностями.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Текущие моды</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (by mezz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-options\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default Options (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/light-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\">Light Overlay (Rift/Forge/Fabric) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">ConnectedTexturesMod (by tterrag1098)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randompatches-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">RandomPatches (Forge) (by TheRandomLabs)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-vibrant-journeys\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project: Vibrant Journeys (by solis_nova123)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-storage-1-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender Storage 1.8.+ (by covers1624)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Voice Chat (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers (by Texelsaur)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod (by MrCrayfish)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transliterationlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">TRansliterationLib (by tr9zw)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Forge) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mermaid-tail-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mermaid Tail Mod (by ThatPreston)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gravestone-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">GraveStone Mod (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Forge) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-person-model\" rel=\"nofollow\">First-person Model (Forge/Fabric) (by tr9zw)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buzzier-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buzzier Bees (by TeamAbnormals)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kleeslabs\" rel=\"nofollow\">KleeSlabs (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldeditcui-forge-edition-3\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldEditCUI Forge Edition 3 (by hexosse)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spark\" rel=\"nofollow\">spark (by Iucko)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swingthroughgrass\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwingThroughGrass (by exidex)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel (by tterrag1098)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libra-an-origins-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Libra - An Origins Addon (by JaselUmena)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/macaws-trapdoors\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Trapdoors (by sketch_macaw)</a></li>\n<li><a hr